# AT-only force field for dodecane_at.data -- generated by backmap-prep, do not edit.
# Same force field as the hybrid at lambda = 1; 1-4 pairs listed explicitly (their own LJ parameters).

pair_style lj/cut/coul/cut 14 9
pair_coeff 1 1 0.2072539061 3.747918463
pair_coeff 1 2 0.14260492 3.905823498
pair_coeff 2 2 0.09812197803 4.070381293

bond_style gromos
bond_coeff 1 42.72227533 1.53

angle_style cosine/squared
angle_coeff 1 63.33652008 111

dihedral_style harmonic
dihedral_coeff 1 1.414913958 1 3

special_bonds lj 0.0 0.0 0 coul 0.0 0.0 0

neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

fix pairs14 all backmap/pairs at file dodecane_at.pairs14.dat
fix_modify pairs14 energy yes virial yes
